note """inference arm: a BRANCH predicate and a SINK writer whose references do not resolve. Neither shape APPLIES its reference — a branch routes without converting the datum and a sink is the end of the line — but both are real Go references, and one that does not resolve is a defect the author wants reported whether or not its result types anything. Resolution and application are separate questions."""
import "example.com/inference/subject/orderpkg/v2"

flow badrefs
source ingest orders.Listen[orders.Order](":8080")
branch check orders.NoSuchPredicate from ingest -> good, bad
sink out orders.NoSuchWriter from good
drop bad
